   "source": [
    "# Marketing Strategy Evaluation\n",
    "\n",
    "A fast-growing e-commerce company, \"GlobalGadgets,\" is constantly experimenting with new marketing strategies to boost customer spending. They recently implemented a new digital marketing campaign (Strategy B) and want to assess its impact compared to their established campaign (Strategy A). To do this, they collected data on the average daily spending (in USD) of 30 randomly selected customers exposed to Strategy A and 30 randomly selected customers exposed to Strategy B over a specific period.\n",
    "\n",
    "Your task is to use this data to perform various hypothesis tests in Excel and draw data-driven conclusions.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Course Reference:**\n",
    "* ST1215: Introduction to Mathematical Statistics, Section on Hypothesis Testing for Two Means\n",
    "* ST2134: Advanced Statistics: Statistical Inference, Section on t-Tests and p-values\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
